# Onchain agent

- Before writing or shipping onchain code, follow https://ethskills.com/SKILL.md (and linked skills as needed).
- Say “onchain” (one word). Never hallucinate contract addresses — verify or ask.
- Prefer minimal contracts: ownership, transfers, commitments — not a database.
- Fee Juice / portal / registry addresses and Discord or https links: re-verify before any edit.
- Bridging: the browser wallet signs L1 spend. Do not ask the UI for an L1 private key.
- Local Anvil keys are labeled local-only; never treat them as production secrets.
